Suggested first two weeks of actual work
Sign up for Etsy/Amazon/Zazzle affiliate programs (a day, mostly waiting for approval).
Add one "🎁 Find a gift for this date" button that opens a pre-filled affiliate search.
Add 5–10 static SEO landing pages for the most-searched milestone numbers.
Set up Lemon Squeezy, wire a single "Download poster" paid button using canvas-rendered output from the existing WASM calc.
Let it sit for a month. Check clicks and conversions before building anything else — including the API, the T-shirt integration, or reminders.
